data: {"answer": "這裡是宴會廳門口，系統顯示身分驗證和授權都通過了，門已經打開。\n現場可見的防護措施包括多因素驗證、防釣魚多因素驗證、最小權限與角色權限。\n你可以繼續前往宴會廳（活動與 CRM）或資安訓練室。", "go": [{"key": "banquet", "en": "Banquet Hall · Events & CRM", "zh": "宴會廳・活動與 CRM", "base_en": "Banquet Hall", "base_zh": "宴會廳", "url": "https://livetour.istaging.com/6a1e0bab-b805-4788-935b-97a06a024613?index=11", "tour": "A", "why_en": "Next in the story", "why_zh": "故事的下一站"}], "followups": [{"text": "活動報名報到系統是做什麼的？", "en": "What does the Event Registration & Check-in do?", "zh": "活動報名報到系統是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "接下來要去哪？", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "zh", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.03, "answer_s": 8.49, "total_s": 8.55}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "door_6d03", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "door_6d03"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 20.1}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "door_6d03", "label": "Room", "en": "Banquet Hall Door (open)", "zh": "宴會廳門口（打開）"}, {"key": "event_system", "label": "System", "en": "Event Registration & Check-in", "zh": "活動報名報到系統"}, {"key": "mfa", "label": "Control", "en": "Multi-Factor Authentication", "zh": "多因素驗證"}, {"key": "phish_resistant_mfa", "label": "Control", "en": "Phishing-Resistant MFA", "zh": "防釣魚多因素驗證"}, {"key": "least_privilege", "label": "Control", "en": "Least Privilege & Role-Based Access", "zh": "最小權限與角色權限"}, {"key": "c_authentication", "label": "Concept", "en": "Authentication Factors", "zh": "驗證因素"}, {"key": "c_zero_trust", "label": "Concept", "en": "Zero Trust", "zh": "零信任"}], "edges": [{"a": "event_system", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "door_6d03"}, {"a": "c_zero_trust", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "door_6d03"}, {"a": "c_zero_trust", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "least_privilege"}, {"a": "c_zero_trust", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "mfa"}, {"a": "c_authentication", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "door_6d03"}, {"a": "c_authentication", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "phish_resistant_mfa"}, {"a": "c_authentication", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "mfa"}, {"a": "mfa", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "door_6d03"}, {"a": "phish_resistant_mfa", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "door_6d03"}, {"a": "least_privilege", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "door_6d03"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "房間：宴會廳門口・驗證通過（導覽裡的名稱：宴會廳門口（打開））\n這裡講的是：兩種驗證都通過，門打開了：身分驗證完成，接著由授權決定你能做什麼。\n重點：驗證是確認你是誰，授權是決定你能用什麼。\n這裡的系統：活動報名報到系統\n看得到的防護措施：多因素驗證、防釣魚多因素驗證、最小權限與角色權限\n課程概念：驗證因素、零信任\n可以走到：宴會廳・活動與 CRM、資安訓練室", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 8.49, "load_s": 0.01, "prompt_tokens": 652, "prompt_s": 2.99, "gen_tokens": 66, "gen_s": 5.44, "tok_per_s": 12.1, "first_token_s": 3.05}}, "state": {}}

